function currentAiResult(){const saved=ai.resultsByMarket?.[primaryCode]||null;if(aiPreviewResult&&(aiPreviewResult.marketCode===primaryCode||!aiPreviewResult.marketCode))return aiPreviewResult;return saved||(ai.lastResult?.marketCode===primaryCode?ai.lastResult:null)}
function renderProbabilities(){const result=currentAiResult(),horizons=result?.horizons||[],first=horizons[0],direction=$('probability-direction'),summary=$('probability-summary'),meta=$('probability-meta');if(!direction||!summary)return;if(!first){direction.className='direction-badge neutral';direction.textContent='等待分析';summary.textContent='概率来自已保存的最近一次 AI 分析，行情变化不会伪造概率。';if(meta)meta.innerHTML='<span>等待分析数据</span>';return}const values=[['看涨',Number(first.up)||0,'up'],['震荡',Number(first.flat)||0,'neutral'],['看跌',Number(first.down)||0,'down']].sort((a,b)=>b[1]-a[1]),lead=values[0];direction.className=`direction-badge ${lead[2]}`;direction.textContent=`${lead[0]} ${lead[1]}%`;summary.textContent=result.summary||first.view||'分析已完成';if(meta){const facts=result.facts||{},quoteAt=Math.max(Date.parse(facts.askObservedAt||0)||0,Date.parse(facts.bidObservedAt||0)||0),fresh=quoteAt&&Date.now()-quoteAt<120000,tokens=Number(result.usage?.totalTokens||0),checked=result.lastCheckedAt||result.generatedAt;meta.innerHTML=`<span><b>生成</b> ${dateText(result.generatedAt)}</span><span><b>更新</b> ${dateText(checked)}</span><span class="${fresh?'fresh':'stale'}"><b>行情</b> ${quoteAt?timeText(quoteAt):'时间未知'} · ${fresh?'新鲜':'已延迟'}</span><span><b>资讯</b> ${Number(result.inputNewsCount??facts.availableNewsCount??facts.newsCount)||0}条</span><span><b>模型</b> ${escapeHtml(result.model||'DeepSeek')}</span>${result.analysisMs?`<span><b>耗时</b> ${(Number(result.analysisMs)/1000).toFixed(1)}秒</span>`:''}${tokens?`<span><b>Token</b> ${tokens.toLocaleString()}</span>`:''}${result.reused?'<span class="fresh">复用缓存</span>':''}`}}
function renderAiHistory(){const host=$('ai-history-list');if(!host)return;const history=Array.isArray(ai.historyByMarket?.[primaryCode])?ai.historyByMarket[primaryCode]:[];host.innerHTML=history.length?history.map((result,index)=>{const first=result.horizons?.[0],lead=first?[['看涨',Number(first.up)||0],['震荡',Number(first.flat)||0],['看跌',Number(first.down)||0]].sort((a,b)=>b[1]-a[1])[0]:['未分类',0];return `<button class="ai-history-row" data-ai-history-index="${index}"><time>${dateText(result.generatedAt)}</time><strong>${lead[0]} ${lead[1]}%</strong><span>${escapeHtml(result.model||'DeepSeek')}</span><small>${escapeHtml(result.summary||'无摘要')}</small></button>`}).join(''):'<div class="empty-block">完成分析后显示历史记录</div>'}
function renderAi(){
  renderAiHistory();
  $('ai-enabled').checked=!!ai.enabled;$('ai-auto-enabled').checked=ai.autoAnalyze!==false;$('ai-auto-time-1').value=ai.autoTimes?.[0]||'09:30';$('ai-auto-time-2').value=ai.autoTimes?.[1]||'15:30';$('ai-key').value='';$('ai-key').placeholder=ai.hasApiKey?`已保存，尾号 ${ai.keyTail}`:'sk-...';$('ai-model').value=ai.model==='deepseek-v4-pro'?'deepseek-v4-pro':'deepseek-v4-flash';const result=currentAiResult();
  if(!result){renderProbabilities();$('ai-state').className=`notice ${ai.lastError?'bad':'info'}`;$('ai-state').innerHTML=ai.lastError?`<i class="ph ph-warning"></i><span>${escapeHtml(publicAiError(ai.lastError))}</span>`:'<i class="ph ph-info"></i><span>请先保存DeepSeek设置，再点击“立即分析”。AI内容仅作市场观察。</span>';$('ai-brief-content').className='market-horizons empty';$('ai-brief-content').innerHTML='<div><span>未来1天</span><strong>—</strong></div><div><span>未来3天</span><strong>—</strong></div><div><span>未来1周</span><strong>—</strong></div><div><span>未来1个月</span><strong>—</strong></div>';return}
  $('ai-state').className=`notice ${ai.lastError?'bad':'good'}`;$('ai-state').innerHTML=ai.lastError?`<i class="ph ph-warning"></i><span>${escapeHtml(publicAiError(ai.lastError))}；下方保留的是上次成功结果。</span>`:`<i class="ph ph-check-circle"></i><span>分析生成于 ${dateText(result.generatedAt)} · ${escapeHtml(result.model||'DeepSeek')}${result.usage?.totalTokens?` · 本次 ${Number(result.usage.totalTokens).toLocaleString()} tokens`:''}</span>`;
  $('ai-result').querySelector('.analysis-summary').innerHTML=`<h3>当前结论</h3><p>${escapeHtml(result.summary)}</p>${result.risks?.length?`<ul>${result.risks.map(x=>`<li>${escapeHtml(x)}</li>`).join('')}</ul>`:''}`;
  const previous=(ai.historyByMarket?.[primaryCode]||[]).find(row=>row.generatedAt!==result.generatedAt),previousByLabel=new Map((previous?.horizons||[]).map(row=>[row.label,row]));$('horizon-list').innerHTML=(result.horizons||[]).map(h=>{const old=previousByLabel.get(h.label),delta=old?Number(h.up)-Number(old.up):null,deltaText=delta==null?'':` · 较上次上涨情景 ${delta>0?'+':''}${delta}个百分点`;return `<article class="horizon-card"><header><strong>${escapeHtml(h.label)}</strong><span>${escapeHtml(h.view)}</span></header><progress class="probability-bar" max="100" value="${Number(h.up)||0}" aria-label="上涨情景概率"></progress><small>上涨 ${h.up}% · 震荡 ${h.flat}% · 下跌 ${h.down}%${deltaText}</small>${h.reasons?.length?`<p>${h.reasons.map(escapeHtml).join('；')}</p>`:''}</article>`}).join('')||'<div class="empty-block">本次未返回周期数据</div>';
  const aiNews=result.news||[];$('news-list').classList.remove('expanded');$('news-list').innerHTML=aiNews.map(n=>{const classified=['看涨','看跌','中性'].includes(n.sentiment)&&['高','中','低'].includes(n.strength);return `<article class="news-item ${classified?'':'pending-analysis'}"><header><span class="sentiment ${classified?escapeHtml(n.sentiment):'待分析'}">${classified?escapeHtml(n.sentiment):'待重新分析'}</span>${classified?`<b>${escapeHtml(n.strength)}影响</b>`:''}</header><button data-news-url="${escapeHtml(n.url)}">${escapeHtml(n.title)}</button><p>${escapeHtml(n.impact||'旧版结果缺少资讯方向，请重新运行分析。')}</p><small>${dateText(n.publishedAt)} · ${escapeHtml(n.source||'金十数据')}</small></article>`}).join('')||'<div class="empty-block">本次采用的融通金快讯中暂无相关事件</div>';
  $('ai-events-toggle').hidden=aiNews.length<=6;$('ai-events-toggle').textContent='展开全部';
  renderProbabilities();const horizons=(result.horizons||[]).slice(0,4);$('ai-brief-content').className='market-horizons';$('ai-brief-content').innerHTML=horizons.map(h=>{const values=[['看涨',Number(h.up)||0,'up'],['震荡',Number(h.flat)||0,'flat'],['看跌',Number(h.down)||0,'down']].sort((a,b)=>b[1]-a[1]),lead=values[0];return `<div class="brief-horizon"><header><span>${escapeHtml(h.label)}</span><b class="${lead[2]}">${lead[0]} ${lead[1]}%</b></header><strong>${escapeHtml(h.view)}</strong><div class="brief-probs"><b class="up">涨 ${Number(h.up)||0}%</b><b class="flat">震 ${Number(h.flat)||0}%</b><b class="down">跌 ${Number(h.down)||0}%</b></div></div>`}).join('')||'<span>暂无周期结论</span>';
}
